# Mock mode requires no credentials.
# Real mode: pass --api-key-file /path/to/local-export.csv (vertical Alibaba CSV),
# or configure DASHSCOPE_API_KEY and DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL in the process environment.
# This file is documentation; the program does not automatically load .env files.
DASHSCOPE_API_KEY=
DASHSCOPE_BASE_URL=
# Example URL shape: https://<workspace-id>.cn-beijing.maas.aliyuncs.com/compatible-mode/v1
